# The deployed Jaynie's Collection site. This is a PUBLIC url, not a secret.
#
# The value below is the real production site, so copying this file and starting
# the app just works. NEVER use localhost here: a physical phone cannot reach a
# laptop on :3000, and AGENTS.md rule 7 forbids hard-coding a host.
#
# If the shop shows "Could not load the shop" or sign-in says it could not reach
# the server, this file is the first thing to check. That exact failure was caused
# by a leftover placeholder value here, which resolved as a real host and answered
# every API call with a 404.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://jaynies-collection.vercel.app